## Third-party model license inventory

This is the current license inventory for the FastEmbed 6.0.2 artifact groups declared in
`models-manifest.toml`, reviewed on 2026-09-15. It records the model/original license separately
from the selected cache or ONNX-conversion repository where that distinction matters. A listed
license is not an assertion that a locally downloaded file matches a particular upstream revision;
release admission still requires an exact revision and file-hash match.

